WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.351
1. Go to Contract fields and click Add field under the right section.

2
00:00:02.351 --> 00:00:09.729
2. Type the Label, choose the Kind of field, and add help if it's useful.

3
00:00:09.729 --> 00:00:13.270
3. Choose where it shows (the Contracts list, Excel) and whether it changes only through a Variation.

4
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:20.741
4. Click Add field, check the preview, then Save changes. Nothing changes for anyone until you save.
